OL,3,APaddy Power-owner cuts 1,400 jobs and
OL,4,Ablames betting tax rises
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaddy Power-owner Flutter has announced
OL,7,Fplans to cut up to 1,400 jobs as its
OL,8,Fboss claimed the company "cannot fully
OL,9,Fabsorb" tax rises imposed on the
OL,10,Fgambling industry last year.
OL,12,FStaff based in the UK and Ireland, as
OL,13,Fwell as British and Irish workers at
OL,14,FFlutter's sites in Portugal and Romania
OL,15,Fwill be affected, but what roles are at
OL,16,Frisk has not been disclosed.
OL,18,FThe government increased taxes on
OL,19,Fonline casino and sports betting, with
OL,20,Fan exemption for horse racing, in the
OL,21,FBudget last November.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
