OL,3,APaddy Power-owner cuts 1,400 jobs and
OL,4,Ablames betting tax rises
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlutter boschief executive Kevin
OL,7,FHarrington said the rise had
OL,8,F"fundamentally changed" the economic
OL,9,Fmodel of the UK betting and gaming
OL,10,Findustry, arguing it had helped "fuel
OL,11,Fthe unlicensed, unregulated market".
